<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Interview Questions Metadata</title>
    <link href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.3.0/dist/css/bootstrap.min.css" rel="stylesheet">
    <style>
        body {
            padding: 20px;
            background-color: #f8f9fa;
        }
        .container {
            max-width: 800px;
            background: white;
            padding: 20px;
            border-radius: 8px;
            box-shadow: 0 0 10px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
        }
        .content {
            display: none;
        }
        .gap-2 {
            gap: 0.5rem;
        }
        h5 {
            margin-top: 1rem;
            margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <div class="container">
        <h2 class="mb-4">📚💡 <strong>Interview Questions Metadata</strong></h2>
        <p class="mb-4">
            A full-stack application designed to organize, manage, and serve interview questions and technical documentation stored as Markdown files.
        </p>

        <div class="mb-4">
            <h5>🔗 <strong>Quick Links:</strong></h5>
            <div class="d-flex flex-wrap gap-2 mb-3">
                <a href="/v1/pages/admin/content-details/itr1" class="btn btn-outline-primary btn-sm">
                    📄 Content Browser (v1)
                </a>
                <a href="/api-docs" class="btn btn-outline-success btn-sm" target="_blank">
                    📘 Swagger UI
                </a>
                <a href="/docs" class="btn btn-outline-info btn-sm" target="_blank">
                    📗 Redocly Docs
                </a>
                <a href="/api-docs/swagger.json" class="btn btn-outline-secondary btn-sm" target="_blank">
                    📋 OpenAPI JSON
                </a>
            </div>
        </div>

        <button class="btn btn-primary btn-sm mb-3" onclick="toggleContent()">Read More</button>

        <div class="content">
            <h4>✅ <strong>Tech Stack:</strong></h4>
            <ul>
                <li><strong>Frontend:</strong> EJS (Embedded JavaScript Templates)</li>
                <li><strong>Backend:</strong> Express.js, Node.js</li>
                <li><strong>API Documentation:</strong> Swagger UI, Redocly (OpenAPI 3.0)</li>
                <li><strong>Markdown Processing:</strong> Marked</li>
                <li><strong>Testing:</strong> Jest, Supertest</li>
                <li><strong>Data Fetching:</strong> Axios</li>
            </ul>

            <h4>✅ <strong>Key Features:</strong></h4>
            <ul>
                <li>Renders Markdown (<code>.md</code>) files placed in a <strong>base folder</strong> or any of its subdirectories.</li>
                <li>Uses <strong>Express and EJS</strong> for a smooth rendering experience.</li>
                <li><strong>RESTful API</strong> with slug-based content retrieval (v2).</li>
                <li><strong>Interactive API Documentation</strong> with Swagger UI and Redocly.</li>
                <li><strong>File tree navigation</strong> for easy browsing of content.</li>
                <li>Centralized repository for interview questions across multiple topics (Java, React, AWS, Docker, etc.).</li>
            </ul>

            <h4>📚 <strong>API Versions:</strong></h4>
            <ul>
                <li><strong>v1:</strong> Page-based rendering with file tree navigation</li>
                <li><strong>v2:</strong> JSON API with slug-based content access</li>
            </ul>
        </div>
    </div>

    <script>
        function toggleContent() {
            const content = document.querySelector('.content');
            const button = document.querySelector('button');
            if (content.style.display === 'none' || content.style.display === '') {
                content.style.display = 'block';
                button.textContent = 'Read Less';
            } else {
                content.style.display = 'none';
                button.textContent = 'Read More';
            }
        }
    </script>

</body>
</html>
